    "content": "\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f **WebRTC P2P Spatial Voice Lounges Deployed!**\n\nTeam voice communications are now fully operational in the `#Voice Lounges` sector:\n\u2022 **P2P Audio Mesh**: Crystal-clear, ultra-low-latency WebRTC peer connections with automated Opus codec negotiation.\n\u2022 **Active Speaker Detection**: Visual aura pulses indicating who is currently transmitting audio.\n\u2022 **Tactical Controls**: Instant microphone mute, audio deafen, and real-time room presence indicator.\n\u2022 **Lounge Room Discovery**: One-click join and room creation directly from the navigation sidebar.",
