    "content": "\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **UI Modernization & Clan Allies Privacy Enhancement**\n\nToday's update delivers critical visual polish and privacy enhancements:\n\u2022 **Friends-Only Clan Allies**: The right sidebar roster now strictly displays your verified shinobi allies and accepted comrades.\n\u2022 **Universal Circular Avatars**: Clean image rendering for all custom photo avatars with fallback support and zero text overflow.\n\u2022 **Streamlined Navigation**: Access the Android APK, Cyber Academy, and Voice Lounges with single-click shortcuts in the navigation rail.",
