    "user": "connecto_admin",
    "avatar": "\ud83d\udc7e",
    "sender": "connecto_admin",
    "sender_username": "connecto_admin",
    "content": "\ud83d\ude80 **CONNECTO PLATFORM RELEASE v3.5.5 IS LIVE!**\n*Stitch MCP & UI/UX Pro Max Architecture Overhaul \u2022 Complete Ecosystem Update*\n\nWe are thrilled to announce **Release v3.5.5**, delivering a comprehensive visual, architectural, and performance overhaul across both the **Connecto Web Platform** (https://connecto.fun) and the **Connecto Native Android Application**.\n\nThis channel (`#announcements`) is strictly reserved for official releases, feature updates, and technical changelogs. Here are the full details:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf10 **WEBSITE & WEB PLATFORM UPDATES (v3.5.5)**\n\n1. **Stitch MCP & UI/UX Pro Max Token System**\n   \u2022 **Color Hierarchy**: Deep-space multi-tiered surfaces (`#08090D` void, `#0D0F17` surface, `#131622` elevated card, `#1E2235` hover, `#252B42` active).\n   \u2022 **Luxury Accents**: Electric Indigo (`#6366F1`), Emerald Pulse (`#10B981`), Cyber Amber (`#F59E0B`), and Crimson Alert (`#F43F5E`).\n   \u2022 **Glassmorphic Depth**: 1px subtle luminous borders (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`), backdrop filters (`backdrop-blur-xl`), and ambient elevation glows.\n\n2. **Framer Motion Spring Dynamics**\n   \u2022 **Physics-Based Transitions**: Engineered with `stiffness: 400, damping: 25` for natural, tactile spring animations across all modals, drawers, and tabs.\n   \u2022 **Micro-Interactions**: Hover scales, active presses (`scale: 0.96`), and smooth stagger entrance effects on channel lists and message bubbles.\n\n3. **Floating Island Bottom Dock (Mobile)**\n   \u2022 **Ergonomic Quick Navigation**: Floating bottom dock with high-contrast active icons for `#rooms`, `@dms`, `\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f voice stage`, and `\ud83d\udc64 profile`.\n   \u2022 **Haptic Touch Response**: Native-feeling spring pop when navigating between views on smartphone touchscreens.\n\n4. **Live Cyber-Stage Audio Visualizer & Soundbars**\n   \u2022 **Real-Time Equalizer Pill**: Integrated 3-bar animated frequency equalizer oscillating in real time during active audio transmissions.\n   \u2022 **Neon Pulse Beacon**: Emerald pulse indicator signaling live room activity and low-latency voice telemetry.\n\n5. **Community Discovery Matrix**\n   \u2022 **Tactical Sector Grid**: Explore public channels, gaming lounges, and developer rooms with real-time active participant badges.\n   \u2022 **Instant Join**: 1-click room teleportation without full page reloads.\n\n6. **Mobile 390px Zero-Overflow Optimization**\n   \u2022 **Sub-Pixel Hardening**: Strict layout constraints preventing horizontal scroll on compact viewports (iPhone 12/13/14/15, Pixel 7/8).\n   \u2022 **Compact Top Navigation**: Telemetry ping pill, drawer hamburger, and quick-action icons neatly nested with zero clipping.\n\n7. **Dynamic Shinobi Bio & Character Counter**\n   \u2022 **Live Input Validation**: Real-time 160-character counter with color-shifting warning states and instant profile sync.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcf1 **CONNECTO NATIVE ANDROID APP UPDATES (v3.5.5)**\n\n\u2022 **Version**: `v3.5.5` (Build `27`)\n\u2022 **Package Size**: `56.88 MB` (56,881,953 bytes)\n\u2022 **Android OS Compatibility**: Android 7.0 (Nougat, API 24) through Android 15+ (Vanilla Ice Cream, API 35)\n\u2022 **Architecture**: Universal APK (`arm64-v8a`, `armeabi-v7a`, `x86_64`)\n\n1. **Jetpack Compose Stitch MCP Architecture**\n   \u2022 Dark luxury theme synchronized with web design tokens.\n   \u2022 Pure Black OLED support with high-contrast text rendering and sub-pixel edge alignment.\n\n2. **Framer Motion Spring Equivalent in Compose**\n   \u2022 Integrated `spring(stiffness = 400f, dampingRatio = 0.8f)` for snappy, fluid tab transitions, modal sheets, and button clicks.\n\n3. **Android Voice Stage Equalizer & Floating Dock**\n   \u2022 `ConnectoTopHeader.kt` updated with animated 3-bar soundbar equalizer active during voice sessions.\n   \u2022 Dedicated Voice Stage tab on the floating bottom navigation with a pulsing live status dot.\n\n4. **Friends-Only DM Security & Locked Banner**\n   \u2022 Strict alliance gating: Direct messaging is secured exclusively for accepted comrades.\n   \u2022 Non-friend DM attempts present a luxury glassmorphic locked notice with a 1-tap \"Send Friend Request\" action.\n\n5. **Resilient WebRTC Mesh & STUN/TURN Fallback**\n   \u2022 Ultra-low latency P2P audio calling with automated coturn relay fallback via `connecto.fun:3478`.\n   \u2022 Real-time speaker aura pulses and instant mute/deafen controls.\n\n6. **Direct APK Download & Verification**\n   \u2022 **Direct Download**: https://connecto.fun/downloads/connecto.apk\n   \u2022 **Versioned URL**: https://connecto.fun/downloads/connecto-v3.5.5.apk\n   \u2022 Instant installation with no third-party app store requirements.\n\n---\n\n*Thank you for being part of the Connecto community. Report any feedback or bugs in `#dev-chat`!*",
