    "sender_username": "connecto_admin",
    "content": "\ud83d\ude80 **CONNECTO PLATFORM RELEASE v3.6.1 IS LIVE!**\n*Next.js 15 Pro Max Workstation \u2022 WebSocket Mesh Sync \u2022 Global \u2318K Quick Switcher \u2022 Spatial Audio Web Engine*\n\nWe are thrilled to officially deploy **Release v3.6.1**, bringing our flagship Next.js 15 Workstation live to `https://connecto.fun/app`, backed by real-time WebSocket mesh distribution, global Command Palette navigation, complete chat composer micro-features, and hardware microphone spatial audio analysis!\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf10 **1. NEXT.JS 15 WORKSTATION (/app)**\n\u2022 **Obsidian Multi-Tier Workstation**: Pure 4-tier dark luxury cyberpunk UI tokens (`#0A0B10`, `#12141D`, `#1A1D2A`), high-density frosted glassmorphism (`backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`), and responsive desktop/mobile viewports.\n\u2022 **Instant Web App Launch**: Available directly from the website header, hero button, or by navigating to `https://connecto.fun/app`.\n\n---\n\n### \u26a1 **2. BIDIRECTIONAL WEBSOCKET MESH & PERSISTENCE DUAL-COMMIT**\n\u2022 **Real-Time Distribution**: Connected to `wss://connecto.fun/ws/{channel}/{username}` for sub-12ms peer message broadcasting.\n\u2022 **Dual-Commit Database Sync**: Optimistic local state updates paired with asynchronous REST `POST /api/channels/{channel_id}/messages` ensuring guaranteed persistent storage.\n\u2022 **Live Typing Broadcasts**: Synchronized typing status indicators with animated bouncing dots across active channels.\n\n---\n\n### \u2318 **3. INTERACTIVE COMMAND PALETTE (\u2318K / Ctrl+K)**\n\u2022 **Universal Quick Switcher**: Press `\u2318K` or click the search bar anywhere to invoke the fuzzy-search navigation palette.\n\u2022 **Instant Navigation**: Jump between channels (`#general`, `dev-talk`, `announcements`), audio lounges (`Cyber-Stage Audio Lounge`), direct message threads, and quick utility actions.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcac **4. FEATURE-COMPLETE COMPOSER & MARKDOWN SANDBOX**\n\u2022 **File Attachments**: Upload images, audio clips, and documents with visual chips, file sizes, and download links.\n\u2022 **Real Microphone Capture**: Integrated `MediaRecorder` audio capture using native browser media devices.\n\u2022 **16-Expression Reaction Popover**: Quick emoji picker (\ud83d\udc4d, \u2764\ufe0f, \ud83d\ude02, \ud83d\udd25, \ud83d\ude80, \u26a1, \ud83c\udf89, \u2728, \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f, \ud83c\udfa7, \ud83d\udcbb, \ud83e\udd16, \ud83d\udc7e, \ud83d\udc8e, \ud83c\udfaf, \ud83d\udcaf).\n\u2022 **Fenced Code Blocks**: Syntax styling, macOS traffic control dots, and instant one-tap copy button for snippets.\n\u2022 **Inline Editing & Deletion**: Quick inline editing with `Enter` (save) / `Esc` (cancel).\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f **5. SPATIAL AUDIO CYBER-STAGE WITH REAL-TIME VOLUMES**\n\u2022 **Web Audio API Frequency Analysis**: Analyzes real-time microphone volume levels to dynamically drive the speaking halo around avatars on stage.\n\u2022 **Dynamic Speaker Telemetry**: 96kHz lossless spatial audio indicators, encrypted WebRTC mesh, and stage member presence.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcf1 **6. ANDROID NATIVE APP v3.6.1 (56.88 MB)**\n\u2022 **Version & Build**: Version `3.6.1` (Build `29` \u2022 `v3.6.1-stable`)\n\u2022 **Package**: `com.connecto.app`\n\u2022 **Package Size**: `56,881,953 bytes` (`56.88 MB`)\n\u2022 **Download**: Download directly from `https://connecto.fun/download/apk` or the website APK link.",
