    "content": "\ud83d\ude80 **CONNECTO PLATFORM RELEASE v3.8.0 IS LIVE!**\n*Minimalist Obsidian Capsule Input Bar \u2022 5-Screen UI Ecosystem Harmonization \u2022 Quick Dial Voice Cards \u2022 Hardware Vault*\n\nWe are thrilled to officially deploy **Release v3.8.0**, introducing the all-new Minimalist Obsidian Capsule Input Bar (zero AI models or selectors, pure human-to-human communication), harmonized 5-screen UI ecosystem across Web and Android, Quick Dial direct voice calling cards, and cryptographic Hardware Vault!\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcac **1. MINIMALIST OBSIDIAN CAPSULE INPUT BAR**\n\u2022 **Single Unified Capsule**: Seamless rounded obsidian capsule housing the inline emoji launcher `\ud83d\ude0a` on the left, dynamic channel placeholder `Message #general...` in the center, and embedded circular `>` send button on the right inside the capsule.\n\u2022 **Pure Human Communication**: Completely eliminated model selectors, AI switches, and clutter for an aesthetic, high-speed chatting experience.\n\u2022 **Spring Touch Feedback**: Tactile physics-based spring animations on touch and press (`var(--spring-bouncy)`).\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **2. CONNECTO HARDWARE VAULT**\n\u2022 **Biometric Authentication**: Fingerprint glow scanner with cryptographic identity verification for `@username`.\n\u2022 **Device Screen Lock**: Hardware fallback to Device PIN, Pattern, or Password with Zero Bypass.\n\u2022 **Live Auth Status Pill**: Real-time status badge and tactile feedback.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde **3. CALLS HUB & QUICK DIAL**\n\u2022 **Quick Dial Card**: Instant one-tap direct voice dialing with recipient input and dial action.\n\u2022 **Live Filter Chips**: Filter call records instantly by `All`, `Incoming`, `Outgoing`, and `Missed`.\n\u2022 **Call History Management**: Track call duration, direction, timestamps, and single-tap `Clear All` action.\n\n---\n\n### \u2709\ufe0f **4. DIRECT MESSAGES & ACTIVE CONVERSATIONS**\n\u2022 **Search Friends**: Instant handle and name lookup (`Search friends by name or username...`).\n\u2022 **Active Conversations**: Sleek cards displaying user avatars, `@handle`, last message preview, and active status.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe0 **5. HOME DASHBOARD & 5-TAB DOCK**\n\u2022 **Dynamic Greeting**: Time-aware greeting card (`Good morning / afternoon, <name> \ud83d\udc4b`) with live network indicator.\n\u2022 **Quick Action Chips**: Instant shortcuts to `Messages`, `Channels`, `Calls`, and `Profile`.\n\u2022 **5-Tab Navigation Dock**: Floating glassmorphic dock with active pill illumination.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcf1 **6. ANDROID NATIVE APP v3.8.0 (54.25 MB)**\n\u2022 **Version & Build**: Version `3.8.0` (Build `32` \u2022 `v3.8.0-stable`)\n\u2022 **Package**: `com.connecto.app`\n\u2022 **Package Size**: `56,881,929 bytes` (`54.25 MB`)\n\u2022 **SHA256**: `e1fe9b1177b21c6f87440072d1c88979a33106142764996a61e30a3fe2b360a2`\n\u2022 **MD5**: `dfeba01cb2127257dda14e85f32c1056`\n\u2022 **Direct Download**: Download immediately from `https://connecto.fun/download/apk` or the website APK button.",
