    "content": "\ud83d\ude80 **CONNECTO PLATFORM RELEASE v3.9.8 IS LIVE!**\n*Phone View Layout Overhaul \u2022 Profile Pictures in Notifications \u2022 WebRTC Call Hangup & Mute Fixes \u2022 Desktop 1200px Bounded View \u2022 Real-Time Online Comrades Highlighting*\n\nWe are proud to release **Connecto Platform Update v3.9.8**, addressing core mobile usability, multimedia notifications, WebRTC calling reliability, responsive desktop centering, and real-time community presence!\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcf1 **1. RESPONSIVE PHONE VIEW ARCHITECTURE**\n\u2022 **Zero Horizontal Overflow**: Resolved 390px mobile viewport clipping across iPhone & Android devices with strict CSS containment.\n\u2022 **Compact Floating Composer**: Bottom composer dock redesigned with zero screen occlusion and thumb-friendly ergonomics.\n\u2022 **Slide-Over Navigation Drawer**: Channel and DM navigation drawer smoothly slides over the viewport with instant touch backdrop dismissal.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd14 **2. NOTIFICATION CENTER & SENDER PROFILE AVATARS**\n\u2022 **Toast Avatars**: Real-time notification banners now render the sender personalized profile picture in place of generic icons.\n\u2022 **Notification Dropdown Tray**: The unread alert center (`#notifList`) renders high-resolution user avatars with unread indicator badges.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde **3. WEBRTC CALLING ENGINE & DISCONNECT TEARDOWN**\n\u2022 **Mute / Unmute Synchronization**: Interactive audio track toggle with instant visual feedback and bidirectional signaling.\n\u2022 **Instant Remote Hangup**: Fixed state desynchronization where cut calls remained active; peer disconnect and ICE teardown now terminate sessions immediately across all participants.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcbb **4. BALANCED DESKTOP LAYOUT (BOUNDED 1200PX)**\n\u2022 **Full-Viewport Backgrounds**: Seamless edge-to-edge dark/light backgrounds spanning 100% of the display.\n\u2022 **Bounded Content Grids**: Centered content containers strictly capped at 1200px max-width to prevent UI distortion on ultra-wide monitors.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udfe2 **5. REAL-TIME PRESENCE & ONLINE COMRADES ENGINE**\n\u2022 **Dynamic Online Highlighting**: Active online comrades glow with vivid green status indicators (`#4ade80`).\n\u2022 **Strict Presence Partitioning**: Dynamically separates online members from offline comrades across channel rosters and friend lists.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfa8 **6. DUAL-THEME COLOR SYSTEM PARITY (WEB & ANDROID)**\n\u2022 **Pure Black OLED (Noir)**: True `#000000` canvas, `#080808` surfaces, `#FFFFFF` crisp text, and vibrant status accents.\n\u2022 **Ivory Paper (Parchment)**: Warm archival `#FBF8F2` canvas, pure `#FFFFFF` cards, `#141312` Sumi ink text, and `#E7E2D8` borders.\n\u2022 **Identical Color Parity**: Android Native application theme engine now matches the web editorial palette 1:1.",
